# Button

A token-driven action component that renders a button or link.

## Variants

Select visual emphasis with `variant`. The viewer shows the same source used by the preview.

<DocsExample title="Button" source={buttonExampleSource} htmlSource={buttonExampleHtmlSource}>
	<ButtonExample />
</DocsExample>

## Options

Buttons support three text sizes, square icon sizes, named radii, and full-width layout. Supplying `href` renders a link with the same visual API.

